  triage:triageNote "TEAM-LEAD ADJUDICATION: phase-AD is final closure sprint. substantive-evidence bar applies (req-qa interpretation), not literal-presence bar (arch-qa interpretation). direct-fix-track.md must cite concrete accepted-line evidence for: (1) AD9-BLANKPANE-001 fix to tmux_pane_id drift per sprint-AD9.md Acceptance Criteria, (2) ERRDOC-001 documentation of CLI error contract entries (ATM_MEMBER_ALREADY_EXISTS, ATM_MEMBER_NOT_FOUND, ATM_IDENTITY_UNAVAILABLE, ATM_TEAM_UNAVAILABLE, ATM_IDENTITY_INVALID, ATM_TEAM_INVALID) per sprint-AD9.md. Score as Important, not Blocking. Route to fix-track for substantive evidence addition." .

